Instance ID  : i-0eea9312c1d8fc04a
Deployed via : GitHub Actions (deploy-to-aws.yml)
Reverse proxy: Nginx on port 80 -> Node.js app on port 3000

Files Created:
- infrastructure/terraform/aws-free-tier/modules/nginx/nginx.conf
- scripts/deploy/setup-ec2.sh
- scripts/deploy/deploy-app.sh
- .github/workflows/deploy-to-aws.yml

Deployment Flow:
  push to main
  -> test job     (npm ci + npm test)
  -> build job    (docker build + save as tar + upload artifact)
  -> deploy job   (scp tar + scp nginx.conf + ssh run deploy-app.sh)
  -> verify       (curl /health through Nginx)

GitHub Secrets:
  EC2_HOST    : public IP (changes on every instance start)
  EC2_USER    : ec2-user
  EC2_SSH_KEY : contents of aws-devops-key.pem

Nginx vs ALB:
  Nginx : free, runs on EC2, manual config
  ALB   : ~$16/month, managed by AWS
  Using Nginx to stay within free tier

Instance stopped after verification.

Day 37 complete - Application deployed to AWS
